<title>USA: Boyd says Ill. officials set review date.</title>
<headline>Boyd says Ill. officials set review date.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boyd Gaming Corp said Thursday the Illinois Gaming Board has scheduled a meeting for December 3 to review Boyd's proposed acquisition of Par-A-Dice Gaming Corp, owner and operator of Par-A-Dice Riverboat Casino in East Peoria, Ill.</p>
</text>
